  "historical_output_text": " Subject: Clarifying Routine Process and Inviting Questions\n\nDear Team,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing to clarify the routine process for the submission of monthly expense reports. To ensure that these reports are processed efficiently and accurately, please follow these steps:\n\n1. Complete the expense report form on the company's internal portal by the 15th of each month.\n2. Attach all supporting documents, such as receipts and invoices, to the form.\n3. Submit the report before the 20th of the month for processing.\n4. If you encounter any difficulties or have any questions, do not hesitate to reach out to the finance team for assistance.\n\nPlease feel free to ask any questions you may have regarding this process. Your feedback is valuable to us, and we aim to make our workflows as smooth and efficient as possible.\n\nThank you for your cooperation and attention to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Your Contact Information] \n\n[Company Name] \n\n[Date] \n\n[Optional: Attachment(s) - If necessary, include a document or additional information that might be helpful.] \n\n[End of Email]",
